Ghidorah was always one of their weapons.

01:04:13.950 --> 01:04:18.860
And King Ghidorah is completely controlled by our computers through magnetic waves.

01:04:20.060 --> 01:04:23.320
We also control Godzilla and Rodan with magnetic waves.

01:04:25.520 --> 01:04:30.000
These monsters can destroy you and together conquer the entire Earth.

01:04:31.820 --> 01:04:35.380
However, we shall delay the orders to kill for 24 hours.

01:04:35.960 --> 01:04:37.280
This is your last chance.

01:04:38.710 --> 01:04:40.150
We await your capitulation.

01:04:44.460 --> 01:04:48.690
He said they control the monsters through magnetic waves.

01:04:49.550 --> 01:04:50.350
Is that significant?

01:04:50.570 --> 01:04:51.170
I think so.

01:04:51.460 --> 01:04:52.240
Come over here.

01:05:02.170 --> 01:05:04.030
A-cycle and magnetic waves.

01:05:04.550 --> 01:05:04.890
Ah.

01:05:06.480 --> 01:05:07.240
Yes, sir.

01:05:12.380 --> 01:05:13.820
Oh, you too?

01:05:13.980 --> 01:05:14.220
You?

01:05:15.870 --> 01:05:17.270
Well, this is a funny place to meet.

01:05:18.410 --> 01:05:19.930
Yeah, I'm going to die laughing.

01:05:20.920 --> 01:05:21.960
No use looking around.

01:05:22.510 --> 01:05:23.970
I've checked every inch in here.

01:05:25.190 --> 01:05:26.320
There's no way out.

01:05:32.270 --> 01:05:33.830
- Why is this room soundproof?

01:05:33.830 --> 01:05:35.630
- Yeah, the walls are soundproof,

01:05:35.630 --> 01:05:37.030
even the bars are soundproof.

01:05:37.030 --> 01:05:49.920
Look at 'em.

01:05:49.920 --> 01:05:52.440
- The final hour is approaching for the people of Earth.

01:05:52.440 --> 01:05:55.420
Hear this, you are to command the forces that mop up.

01:05:55.420 --> 01:05:57.350
No one must survive.

01:05:57.350 --> 01:05:59.600
You are to seek out and kill every human being.

01:06:00.160 --> 01:06:02.020
Action begins in 20 hours.

01:06:08.700 --> 01:06:09.760
Just 15 hours.

01:06:10.490 --> 01:06:11.630
We have no alternative.

01:06:12.200 --> 01:06:13.960
We must use all our nuclear weapons.

01:06:14.560 --> 01:06:15.130
Or that.

01:06:15.780 --> 01:06:17.500
May I suggest we join in prayer?

01:06:18.150 --> 01:06:19.750
I can't see how prayers will help.

01:06:20.000 --> 01:06:20.540
Oh, yes.

01:06:20.870 --> 01:06:22.380
We can at least save our souls.

01:06:22.380 --> 01:06:25.380
We must either attack them now or surrender to them.

01:06:25.830 --> 01:06:26.790
That's the Council's decision.

01:06:27.100 --> 01:06:27.800
Just a moment, sir.

01:06:28.910 --> 01:06:30.000
We have one chance.

01:06:30.540 --> 01:06:32.200
Please give me a few hours to work on it.

01:06:32.420 --> 01:06:33.160
What do you do?

01:06:33.910 --> 01:06:37.170
They're using magnetic waves to manipulate Godzilla and Rodan.

01:06:37.700 --> 01:06:38.870
That's where we have a chance.

01:06:40.420 --> 01:06:43.760
If we are able to sever those waves, we can save the Earth.

01:06:44.310 --> 01:06:46.350
Can you solve the problem in such a short time?

01:06:46.640 --> 01:06:50.340
The odds are long, but we're making our final tests.

01:06:52.370 --> 01:06:53.310
All right, try it again.

01:06:58.140 --> 01:06:59.300
Problem's in the A-cycle.

01:07:00.120 --> 01:07:02.930
Please step in.

01:07:02.930 --> 01:07:07.820
Fuji, counsel, how are you coming?

01:07:07.820 --> 01:07:10.290
All right, theoretically.

01:07:10.290 --> 01:07:11.350
Can you be specific?

01:07:11.350 --> 01:07:12.630
There's not much time.

01:07:12.630 --> 01:07:14.210
Yes, we know.

01:07:14.210 --> 01:07:17.670
What do the tests indicate?

01:07:17.670 --> 01:07:20.790
The tape recorder here is being moved

01:07:20.790 --> 01:07:23.110
by magnetic waves generated over there.

01:07:23.110 --> 01:07:23.950
Turn it off, please.

01:07:23.950 --> 01:07:26.950
- Yes, sir.

01:07:26.950 --> 01:07:27.790
- Turn it on again.

01:07:27.790 --> 01:07:28.160
- Yes, sir.

01:07:31.370 --> 01:07:37.650
If we can shield it, if we can intercept the waves, it'll stop.

01:07:37.650 --> 01:07:45.290
As you can see, this ordinary metal will not intercept the magnetic waves.

01:07:45.290 --> 01:07:51.680
What we must use is that, the A-cycle light ray, which will actually cut off the waves.

01:07:51.680 --> 01:07:54.640
I'll make them visible so you can see what happens.

01:08:13.210 --> 01:08:14.770
- That's good, it works.

01:08:14.770 --> 01:08:16.570
Now what is our problem?

01:08:16.570 --> 01:08:19.530
- Well, thank you.

01:08:19.530 --> 01:08:22.570
We don't know the lengths or intensities

01:08:22.570 --> 01:08:25.500
of the waves they're using.

01:08:25.500 --> 01:08:27.930
- A solution, a laser.

01:08:27.930 --> 01:08:30.000
Concentrate on the upper and lower limits

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:35.490
a cycle? Yes sir. But what if the wavelengths they're using fall outside our frequency range?

01:08:35.490 --> 01:08:42.420
Then a prayer is all we have. We won't get a second chance at it.

01:08:42.420 --> 01:08:59.090
Ten hours to go. Good. All forces on earth ready to attack? Good. Everything has been computed.

01:09:00.600 --> 01:09:04.150
- Yes, sir, everything.

01:09:04.150 --> 01:09:06.020
- Sure is quiet.

01:09:06.020 --> 01:09:11.180
- Yeah, might as well give up.

01:09:11.180 --> 01:09:13.270
We aren't ever gonna get out of here.

01:09:13.270 --> 01:09:14.190
- No, we can't give up.

01:09:14.190 --> 01:09:18.880
Now, try and think why this room is soundproof.

01:09:18.880 --> 01:09:29.160
- Oh, hey, Glenn, look at this.

01:09:30.570 --> 01:09:32.080
This is the note from Namikawa.

01:09:32.080 --> 01:09:33.790
She's the one that got me into this.

01:09:33.790 --> 01:09:35.940
Listen to this.

01:09:35.940 --> 01:09:38.430
Dear Glenn, when you receive this letter,

01:09:38.430 --> 01:09:42.360
I shall have been eliminated for disobeying the directives of our computers.

01:09:42.360 --> 01:09:44.280
But I have no regrets.

01:09:44.280 --> 01:09:48.050
With you, I have found a love beyond all computation.

01:09:48.050 --> 01:09:49.520
You were right.

01:09:49.520 --> 01:09:53.880
Mankind cannot live as machines, because man is immortal.

01:09:53.880 --> 01:09:56.310
A material machine can be destroyed.

01:09:56.310 --> 01:10:00.000
We machines of Planet X can be destroyed by, of all things, a search.

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:07.120
and simple sound a certain sound that's why they sell a soundproof that's it

01:10:07.120 --> 01:10:22.540
that's why they bought my invention you mean this thing will make noise yeah

01:10:22.540 --> 01:10:29.350
it'll shake your teeth loose listen to it

01:10:30.250 --> 01:10:41.620
I'm not going to eat it.

01:11:23.640 --> 01:11:24.450
Just get out of here.

01:11:31.880 --> 01:11:32.880
Commander!

01:11:32.880 --> 01:11:33.880
What is it?

01:11:33.880 --> 01:11:34.880
The Earth prisoners have escaped.

01:11:34.880 --> 01:11:42.950
What?

01:11:42.950 --> 01:11:43.950
Controller!

01:11:43.950 --> 01:11:44.870
Controller!

01:11:44.870 --> 01:11:46.920
Our prisoners have escaped.

01:11:46.920 --> 01:11:47.640
Please handle.

01:12:20.670 --> 01:12:22.400
That's that. Back to control.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:32.160
- That sure was close.

01:12:32.160 --> 01:12:34.920
- Wait till they found out it was their guards on a boat.

01:12:34.920 --> 01:12:37.840
- Yeah, what'll we do now?

01:12:37.840 --> 01:12:40.080
- Well, we sure ain't gonna wait for the next ferry.

01:12:40.080 --> 01:12:40.920
Swim.

01:12:54.550 --> 01:12:57.360
- Five hours to go.

01:12:57.360 --> 01:12:59.760
Everything proceeding as calculated.

01:13:00.480 --> 01:13:00.920
That's good.

01:13:01.680 --> 01:13:02.480
Ninety percent.

01:13:03.090 --> 01:13:03.570
Are you positive?

01:13:04.360 --> 01:13:04.660
Hi.

01:13:05.300 --> 01:13:05.560
Doctor.

01:13:06.490 --> 01:13:08.070
Oh, Glenn, where have you been?

01:13:08.870 --> 01:13:09.930
Wait, look at this.

01:13:10.430 --> 01:13:11.730
The A-cycle light ray.

01:13:12.300 --> 01:13:16.950
If we use a veil of these metal particles, it can intercept their magnetic waves.

01:13:17.090 --> 01:13:17.570
Uh-huh.

01:13:18.840 --> 01:13:19.910
Beat it, Tetsui.

01:13:20.280 --> 01:13:21.730
You shouldn't say that.

01:13:21.930 --> 01:13:22.430
She's right.

01:13:22.510 --> 01:13:25.190
Listen, Fuji, he's got a great idea to knock off these guys.

01:13:25.810 --> 01:13:26.110
Oh?

01:13:26.330 --> 01:13:30.000
The miniature sound transmitter he devised that makes a great damage.

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:30.920
to their physical nature.

01:13:31.160 --> 01:13:31.720
Are you sure?

01:13:32.200 --> 01:13:33.340
We tried it already at work.

01:13:33.400 --> 01:13:34.140
That's why we're here.

01:13:34.240 --> 01:13:34.900
Now, what we got to do

01:13:34.900 --> 01:13:35.680
is we got to put the sound

01:13:35.680 --> 01:13:37.060
to the transmitter on radio waves.

01:13:37.120 --> 01:13:38.000
We got to amplify it

01:13:38.000 --> 01:13:39.140
and then direct it toward the aliens.

01:13:39.220 --> 01:13:39.900
I know it'll work.

01:13:40.020 --> 01:13:40.240
Good.

01:13:40.730 --> 01:13:41.730
Get started right away.

01:13:42.140 --> 01:13:43.180
Only three hours to go.

01:13:43.340 --> 01:13:43.820
Yes, sir.

01:13:44.290 --> 01:13:44.650
Okay.

01:13:48.770 --> 01:13:49.390
Controller, sir.

01:13:49.670 --> 01:13:50.910
Computer shows a discrepancy.

01:13:51.890 --> 01:13:52.130
Why?

01:13:53.440 --> 01:13:54.630
Computer 5.

01:13:55.090 --> 01:13:55.810
What is the trouble?

01:13:56.360 --> 01:13:57.000
We're checking.

01:13:59.360 --> 01:13:59.740
All right.

01:13:59.740 --> 01:13:59.960
All right.

01:14:01.470 --> 01:14:10.770
change our plans. We begin the attack on Earth now. Read the tape. The tape show red dots are

01:14:10.770 --> 01:14:16.640
decreasing. Good. Monster 01 and 02 commence the attack.

01:15:14.560 --> 01:15:17.100
Doctor, doctor, the enemy's already begun the attack.

01:15:18.680 --> 01:15:19.720
Have they discovered our plan?

01:15:20.070 --> 01:15:20.570
Don't know.

01:15:20.790 --> 01:15:21.350
We've got to hurry.

01:15:22.020 --> 01:15:22.840
Come on, get going.

01:15:23.040 --> 01:15:23.380
Yes, sir.

01:15:58.350 --> 01:15:59.480
are returning to normal.

01:16:00.700 --> 01:16:10.920
Good. Increase the attack. We, too, go into action.

01:17:28.800 --> 01:17:29.540
successful.

01:17:31.560 --> 01:17:43.770
Good. We must destroy all moving vehicles.

01:17:43.770 --> 01:17:46.540
Glenn, how are things going here?

01:17:46.540 --> 01:17:49.480
The licking our first trucks have taken is something terrible.

01:17:49.480 --> 01:17:51.160
It doesn't look so hot.

01:17:51.160 --> 01:17:52.660
We'll be broadcasting in a few minutes.

01:17:52.660 --> 01:17:54.350
The mobile unit is also getting ready.

01:17:54.350 --> 01:17:55.910
Good. Keep it up.

01:17:55.910 --> 01:17:57.440
The world's depending on us.

01:17:57.440 --> 01:17:58.040
Okay.

01:18:01.080 --> 01:18:02.320
- Well, let's hurry. - Okay.

01:18:02.320 --> 01:18:14.400
- Things normal? - Yes, sir, they are.

01:18:14.400 --> 01:18:20.070
Order zero to join the attack.

01:18:20.070 --> 01:18:29.060
- Sir! - Hold the second squad in the tunnel till you get an order.

01:18:29.060 --> 01:18:30.000
- Second squad.

01:18:30.350 --> 01:18:31.790
Stay in the tunnel and keep out of sight.

01:18:33.620 --> 01:18:34.460
Yes, sir. We'll hold.

01:22:18.330 --> 01:22:19.170
This machine.

01:22:32.200 --> 01:22:37.480
attention everyone this is an emergency broadcast the unpleasant noise you are about to hear coming

01:22:37.480 --> 01:22:42.970
from your radio is not a mistake please do not turn off your radio but turn up the volume on

01:22:42.970 --> 01:22:53.100
your receiver as high as it can go so that you can make the sound we broadcast as loud as possible

01:22:53.100 --> 01:22:59.600
doctor

01:23:00.220 --> 01:23:03.070
Glenn's begun broadcasting. Stand by to attack.

01:23:03.340 --> 01:23:03.830
Stand by.

01:23:05.930 --> 01:23:08.160
Okay, that does it. Now let's go to Macquarie Island.

01:23:08.740 --> 01:23:09.060
Okay.

01:23:10.340 --> 01:23:13.150
This is an emergency.

01:23:13.750 --> 01:23:17.710
The unpleasant noise you hear on your radio receiver is not a mistake.

01:23:18.170 --> 01:23:23.190
Do not turn off your set, but turn up the volume as high as possible.

01:23:23.730 --> 01:23:24.810
This is an emergency.

01:23:31.400 --> 01:23:32.820
- Something's wrong.

01:23:32.820 --> 01:23:37.300
- Correct it.

01:24:35.470 --> 01:24:39.540
How do things look on the island?

01:24:39.540 --> 01:24:41.940
Quiet.

01:24:41.940 --> 01:24:49.130
Can't see anything.

01:24:49.130 --> 01:24:50.130
It's a flying saucer.

01:24:50.130 --> 01:24:57.790
Oh!

01:24:57.790 --> 01:24:58.790
Okay, you better start transmitting.

01:24:58.790 --> 01:25:00.000
Right.

01:25:00.440 --> 01:25:00.940
Give the order.

01:25:01.400 --> 01:25:01.820
Yes, sir.

01:25:02.540 --> 01:25:02.940
Transmit.

01:25:10.860 --> 01:25:14.840
Computers, calling Colonial Commander.

01:25:15.220 --> 01:25:15.960
Come in, Earth.

01:25:19.680 --> 01:25:25.420
Colonial Commander.

01:25:26.800 --> 01:25:28.300
This is murder!

01:26:15.450 --> 01:26:17.150
- Send the second squad into action.

01:26:17.150 --> 01:26:18.590
- Give the order.

01:26:18.590 --> 01:26:21.000
- Second squad, you are ordered to attack.

01:28:09.600 --> 01:28:13.050
The computers are always invincible! Adjust them to normal!

01:28:13.050 --> 01:28:15.720
Let us retreat! Order! Retreat!

01:28:15.720 --> 01:28:20.580
No! We will recover in attack!

01:28:39.560 --> 01:29:00.000
It's going to crash to that dimension we've never seen.

01:29:02.680 --> 01:29:07.080
All of you, join me in escape!

01:31:13.240 --> 01:31:14.320
Let's get out of here!

01:31:14.320 --> 01:31:15.260
Let's go!

01:31:15.260 --> 01:31:17.250
Let's move out!

01:31:58.860 --> 01:31:59.410
All right, Glenn.

01:32:00.190 --> 01:32:01.760
- What's happening? - Look in the water.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:32.790
He couldn't. They're too tough.

01:32:32.790 --> 01:32:37.940
Thanks, Fooch.

01:32:37.940 --> 01:32:39.830
What can I do?

01:32:39.830 --> 01:32:41.830
Now we deserve a vacation.

01:32:41.830 --> 01:32:43.730
Not you, Glenn.

01:32:43.730 --> 01:32:45.740
You're flying back to Planet X.

01:32:45.740 --> 01:32:48.410
What?

01:32:48.410 --> 01:32:51.450
You're to be our first ambassador.

01:32:51.450 --> 01:33:00.000
Whatever's fair, pal.
